WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.598 --> 00:00:03.957
Ladies, the point of this exercise

00:00:03.957 --> 00:00:08.124
is to see if I am fit for the
Israeli Army, is that correct?

00:00:09.421 --> 00:00:10.334
Yes.

00:00:10.334 --> 00:00:12.443
I have quick moves.

00:00:12.443 --> 00:00:14.008
(laughter)

00:00:14.008 --> 00:00:15.008
Wow, nice.

00:00:17.363 --> 00:00:19.261
Will any of that be good in a fight?

00:00:19.261 --> 00:00:20.998
A fight with clowns.

00:00:20.998 --> 00:00:22.739
(laughter)

00:00:22.739 --> 00:00:23.822
You're a mess.

00:00:23.822 --> 00:00:25.184
What do you mean I'm a mess?

00:00:25.184 --> 00:00:26.815
You're supposed to build up my confidence,

00:00:26.815 --> 00:00:28.212
not say I'm a mess.

00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:29.732
You know, if a battle started now,

00:00:29.732 --> 00:00:33.899
I would be, all day,
putting on this kneepad.

00:00:34.052 --> 00:00:36.112
I'll be right there, you got them!

00:00:36.112 --> 00:00:38.452
Almost there, hold on!

00:00:38.452 --> 00:00:41.956
Almost there and the battle's over.

00:00:41.956 --> 00:00:43.754
The battle's over.

00:00:43.754 --> 00:00:44.837
Oh my gosh.

00:00:46.052 --> 00:00:48.468
Let's be honest, I look like a chef.

00:00:48.468 --> 00:00:50.948
Alright, what do I do first?

00:00:50.948 --> 00:00:52.426
Climbing over a wall.

00:00:52.426 --> 00:00:53.922
I gotta get over this wall my first shot?

00:00:53.922 --> 00:00:54.858
Yeah.

00:00:54.858 --> 00:00:58.180
You know there is another
way, you mind moving aside?

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.020
Look at this.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:02.270
(applause)

00:01:08.974 --> 00:01:11.934
Yes, very good, use your legs.

00:01:11.934 --> 00:01:13.054
Up, up.

00:01:13.054 --> 00:01:13.956
Adin!

00:01:13.956 --> 00:01:14.789
What?

00:01:14.789 --> 00:01:17.513
Adin, get in here, hold my legs!

00:01:17.513 --> 00:01:18.346
Adin, yes!

00:01:22.932 --> 00:01:24.350
Adin!

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:25.492
Adin!

00:01:25.492 --> 00:01:26.325
Push!

00:01:26.325 --> 00:01:27.668
On my ass!

00:01:27.668 --> 00:01:28.501
Push!

00:01:30.345 --> 00:01:31.178
Feel that.

00:01:33.165 --> 00:01:34.248
I don't have?

00:01:38.458 --> 00:01:39.291
Oh god.

00:01:40.606 --> 00:01:41.625
Okay.

00:01:41.625 --> 00:01:42.542
Feels good.

00:01:43.769 --> 00:01:45.862
Wait, I can't walk!

00:01:45.862 --> 00:01:47.124
Yes.

00:01:47.124 --> 00:01:48.142
Yeah!

00:01:48.142 --> 00:01:50.105
It's amazing.

00:01:50.105 --> 00:01:51.871
Almost finished.

00:01:51.871 --> 00:01:53.538
Look, I got a cut!

00:01:54.653 --> 00:01:56.151
I got a cut!

00:01:56.151 --> 00:01:58.452
Call the helicopter!

00:01:58.452 --> 00:01:59.535
Look at that!

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:04.133
(somber music)

